Subject: [PATCH] linearization: changelog entry for invalid operands

---
 changes/02-bugfix/1632-invalid-operand.md | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 changes/02-bugfix/1632-invalid-operand.md

diff --git a/changes/02-bugfix/1632-invalid-operand.md b/changes/02-bugfix/1632-invalid-operand.md
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..fcf60a905
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changes/02-bugfix/1632-invalid-operand.md
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+- An argument, destination or condition of an instruction that the target
+  cannot express, such as a memory access nested in a larger expression, is
+  reported as an error located at the instruction instead of an internal
+  error of linearization
+  ([PR #1632](https://github.com/jasmin-lang/jasmin/pull/1632);
+  fixes [#1126](https://github.com/jasmin-lang/jasmin/issues/1126)).
